  "prefLabel": "Env-Sw 1001.02 Applicability",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Env-Sw 1001.02 Applicability. The rules in this chapter shall apply to all facilities, including permit-exempt facilities, unless otherwise noted.\n\nSource. #6619-B, eff 10-29-97; (See Revision Note at chapter heading for Env-Sw 1000); ss by #8459, eff 10-28-05 (formerly Env-Wm 2701.02); ss by #10598, eff 7-1-14; ss by #13864, eff 2-6-24",
